    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "The Applicant is seeking anticipatory bail in connection with C.R No. 134 of 2024,\nregistered at Pandharpur Police Station, Solapur, on 08/03/2024, under Sections 26(2)(i), 26(2)(ii), 26(2)\n(iv),27(3)(e), 30(2)(a) and 59 of the Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006 and under Vaibhav Dnyaneshwar Phasalkar vs State Of Maharashtra on 18 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/51665179/\n1 sections 188, 272, 273, 328 of the Indian Penal Code.\n2.",
