    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Heard Mr. Rajepandhare, learned counsel for the Applicant and Mr. Mali, learned APP for the Respondent-State.\n y.s.patil   16-ABA-1063-2024.odt 3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1095,
      "end": 1241,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rajepandhare",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 1105,
          "end": 1117
        },
        {
          "text": "Mali",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 1161,
          "end": 1165
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "The FIR is lodged by Food Safety Inspector Umesh Bhuse.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1242,
      "end": 1297,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Umesh Bhuse",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1285,
          "end": 1296
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17346854507923126
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "He has stated that on 07/03/2024, the Police Officer received a secret information that one Sanjay Honrao had a general store, one Aziz Tamboli had one godown and one Sagar Abhangrao had a residential premises where all three of them had stored prohibited articles for sale.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1298,
      "end": 1572,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "07/03/2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1320,
          "end": 1330
        },
        {
          "text": "Sanjay Honrao",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1390,
          "end": 1403
        },
        {
          "text": "Aziz Tamboli",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1429,
          "end": 1441
        },
        {
          "text": "Sagar Abhangrao",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1465,
          "end": 1480
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19121992588043213
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "Therefore, the police officers raided those premises and seized those contraband articles.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1573,
      "end": 1664,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2921062111854553
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Sanjay Honrao had stored pan masala, scented tobacco etc. worth Rs.\n72,515/-.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1665,
      "end": 1742,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sanjay Honrao",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1665,
          "end": 1678
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3151606023311615
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Those articles were the banned articles under Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1743,
      "end": 1825,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1789,
          "end": 1824
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5472981333732605
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "Aziz Tamboli had stored similar articles worth Rs. 5 lakhs and Sagar had stored those articles worth Rs.\n2600/-.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1826,
      "end": 1938,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Aziz Tamboli",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1826,
          "end": 1838
        },
        {
          "text": "Sagar",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1889,
          "end": 1894
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3319128155708313
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "Considering the quantity of the articles, it was clear that they were stored for sale.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1939,
      "end": 2025,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3327055275440216
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "On this basis, the FIR is lodged.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2026,
      "end": 2059,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.36360546946525574
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "During the investigation it transpired that the Applicant had supplied those articles to Sanjay Honrao and Aziz Tamboli, therefore the Applicant is apprehending his arrest.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2060,
      "end": 2232,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sanjay Honrao",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2149,
          "end": 2162
        },
        {
          "text": "Aziz Tamboli",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2167,
          "end": 2179
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.36931678652763367
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "4. Learned counsel for the Applicant made following y.s.patil 2 of 5 16-ABA-1063-2024.odt submissions.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2233,
      "end": 2336,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "(i) Section 328 of the Indian Penal Code is not applicable.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2337,
      "end": 2397,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 328",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2342,
          "end": 2353
        },
        {
          "text": "Indian Penal Code",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2361,
          "end": 2378
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.44204965233802795
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "The only evidence against the Applicant is the statement of the co- accused.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2398,
      "end": 2474,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.256202757358551
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "(ii) There is nothing to show that the Applicant was in touch with either of these persons who had stored those banned articles.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2475,
      "end": 2604,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.31876951456069946
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "5. Learned APP opposed these submissions.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2605,
      "end": 2647,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11862379312515259
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "He produced investigation papers before me.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2648,
      "end": 2691,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "He submitted that the co-accused Sanjay Honrao has stated that those banned articles were supplied by the present Applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2692,
      "end": 2816,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sanjay Honrao",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2725,
          "end": 2738
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27103936672210693
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "Similarly, the co-accused Aziz Tamboli has also stated that those articles were supplied by the present Applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2817,
      "end": 2931,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Aziz Tamboli",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2843,
          "end": 2855
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14317333698272705
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "He submitted that those statements are corroborated by the CDR collected by the Investigating agency.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2932,
      "end": 3033,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22369714081287384
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "There are calls exchanged between the Applicant and Sanjay Honrao.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3034,
      "end": 3100,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sanjay Honrao",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3086,
          "end": 3099
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17803777754306793
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "Therefore, the statement of the co-accused Sanjay is supported by the corroborative Vaibhav Dnyaneshwar Phasalkar vs State Of Maharashtra on 18 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/51665179/\n2 material.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3101,
      "end": 3322,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sanjay",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3144,
          "end": 3150
        },
        {
          "text": "Vaibhav Dnyaneshwar Phasalkar vs State Of Maharashtra on 18 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 3185,
          "end": 3270
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.34332045912742615
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "Learned APP also submitted that there are criminal antecedents against the present Applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3323,
      "end": 3416,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23078501224517822
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "All these offences are registered at Pandharpur Police Station.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3417,
      "end": 3480,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Pandharpur Police Station",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3454,
          "end": 3479
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23924532532691956
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "They are as y.s.patil 3 of 5 16-ABA-1063-2024.odt",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3481,
      "end": 3530,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2002076357603073
    },
